    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Na <strong>être</strong> en <strong>devenir</strong> komt een beroepsnaam <strong>zonder lidwoord</strong>: <em>ma mère est infirmière</em>, <em>je voudrais devenir cuisinier</em>. En <em>être au chômage</em> betekent werkloos zijn — dat is geen beroep."
    },
    {
     "soort": "figuur",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Frans</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Nederlands</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">le travail, travailler</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">het werk, werken</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">un salaire</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een loon</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">un contrat</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een contract</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">un horaire</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een uurregeling</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">un bureau</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een bureau of kantoor</td></tr></table>",
     "onderschrift": "Le travail wordt in het meervoud les travaux."
